comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T20:05:23.028Z",codex-agent,"Real host command tests pass for TOON/JSON tree and replay plus run/resume/full-tree dispatch over HTTP. Packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx consumers passed discovery and command-family acceptance. README covers installation, exported APIs, every command, settings, measured eval and exit codes; ARCHITECTURE records ledger and resume invariants."
  "2026-10-18T23:30:56.180Z",codex-agent,"Review thread WKf: malformed --scope JSON now reports rlm invalid: Invalid --scope JSON with exit 2. Empty scope text retains its existing validation diagnosis, and an unexpected malformed settings file retains the generic command-integrity failure. Focused real-tracker regression covers all three paths."
  "2026-10-19T03:25:31.480Z",codex-agent,"Command regression covers all numeric flags against blanks, signs, NaN, Infinity, exponent/hex forms, fractions, padding and overflow; model, scope and every positional operand reject blanks before creating tracker items. Zero depth, a nonblank model tag and JSON whitespace remain supported. Documented the exact CLI operand policy in README.md."
  "2026-10-19T03:31:16.666Z",codex-agent,"Revert evidence: replacing strict numeric parsing with Number(text(...)) fails the operand regression; removing only the nonblank string guard also fails. Removing only the optional repository-root guard fails the script-entry regression. Valid zero depth and scope JSON whitespace remain accepted. All sources restored byte-for-byte."
  "2026-10-19T03:35:42.926Z",codex-agent,"Final linked-test execution: pm test pm-rlm-kaht --run --only-last --progress passed 1/1 commands with 6/6 focused regressions. Both full release checks passed 108/108 unit tests and all unchanged gates. Operand and quality-root behavior is documented; no command or renderer regressions."
